 ## Background
-The concept of converting between discrete weights and continuous PDFs is fundamental in statistical sampling and volume rendering. The specific formulation using interval widths for stability is documented in implementations such as `density_bounded_ray_weights` [S2, unofficial]. The application of conditional PDFs for multivariate weighting in volume rendering contexts, particularly for level-of-detail selection in climate data, was introduced in work on histogram spectra for multivariate time-varying volume LOD selection [S3]. The term "Weight-PDF Conversion" and its implementation details are also found in projects like InstantSplat [S1, unofficial].
